WEBVTT

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:13.754
Koto.

00:00:15.189 --> 00:00:18.192
| know a secret of yours
that you've treasured

00:00:18.492 --> 00:00:20.261
and kept hidden forever.

00:00:22.696 --> 00:00:23.964
I'm your dad, after all.

00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:27.368
What brought this on?

00:00:32.306 --> 00:00:33.874
That's not fair.

00:00:36.076 --> 00:00:39.747
So I'll tell you my secret, too.

00:00:44.752 --> 00:00:45.419
What is it?

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:46.520
That.

00:00:50.057 --> 00:00:51.191
It's my secret.

00:00:54.662 --> 00:00:55.563
What do you mean?

00:01:07.841 --> 00:01:11.312
| really don't have any idea what
you're talking about, Sensei.

00:01:11.879 --> 00:01:12.780
Don't worry.

00:01:17.918 --> 00:01:19.286
Things will go just fine.

00:01:27.661 --> 00:01:29.229
| hope so.

00:01:37.204 --> 00:01:39.139
| love you, Koto.

00:01:39.873 --> 00:01:41.775
| know, Daddy.

00:01:42.876 --> 00:01:44.311
| love you, too.

00:01:47.348 --> 00:01:48.315
| know.

00:01:49.883 --> 00:01:54.421
A Manga Movie About People
Who Have a Fun, Busy Life!

00:01:54.421 --> 00:01:55.856
Chapter 28: The Present
(22)/ Fundamental Principle

00:02:06.734 --> 00:02:10.037
I'm not going to apologize.

00:02:13.307 --> 00:02:14.008
Koto.

00:02:15.342 --> 00:02:16.477
| love you.

00:02:18.879 --> 00:02:19.880
| love you.

00:02:20.948 --> 00:02:23.951
You, and Koto, and Yakushimaru,

00:02:24.585 --> 00:02:25.919
and Yase and Kurama.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:28.355
My whole world.

00:02:29.390 --> 00:02:30.858
| love them all.

00:02:38.966 --> 00:02:44.304
You once said those
words to me, didn't you?

00:02:49.710 --> 00:02:54.715
But I can't love myself the same way.

00:02:57.484 --> 00:03:02.623
| always doubt myself, Koto.

00:03:04.658 --> 00:03:06.960
God
The ideal world my father wanted,

00:03:07.494 --> 00:03:10.030
the world he left my brother in control of...

00:03:10.764 --> 00:03:12.232
God
Ruling it means

00:03:12.232 --> 00:03:15.069
keeping everything controlled
and in its proper place.

00:03:17.237 --> 00:03:18.405
So what about me?

00:03:19.907 --> 00:03:21.442
The creation of life,

00:03:21.809 --> 00:03:24.211
deciding between
destruction and rebirth...

00:03:25.179 --> 00:03:28.882
My power contradicts
my role as an observer.

00:03:31.218 --> 00:03:35.789
Why did my father give me
that power and then leave?

00:03:37.991 --> 00:03:41.195
What does my father want from me?

00:03:46.633 --> 00:03:50.204
Do you know anything about it, Koto?

00:03:57.077 --> 00:03:58.011
Tell me.

00:03:59.113 --> 00:04:02.015
Just like when you appeared in
front of me, out of nowhere!

00:04:02.683 --> 00:04:03.917
Tell me!

00:04:04.651 --> 00:04:07.821
| may be a god, but I still
need the Buddha's compassion!

00:04:33.113 --> 00:04:37.317
You're like a child. You don't
know how to control yourself.

00:04:38.118 --> 00:04:40.220
Everything you do is overly extravagant.

00:04:41.455 --> 00:04:43.590
You're free, selfish, uninhibited.

00:04:44.691 --> 00:04:45.793
Self-centered.

00:04:47.895 --> 00:04:49.997
A cold-hearted monster.

00:04:50.798 --> 00:04:52.733
Yet, you know how to demand attention.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.902
A proud man,
who can't bear to be alone.

00:04:58.472 --> 00:05:03.043
Buddhalocanii said my
love could save you,

00:05:04.378 --> 00:05:09.783
but I still don't understand you at all.

00:05:13.987 --> 00:05:19.226
The twisted world you want to
destroy is you yourself, isn't it, priest?

00:05:20.394 --> 00:05:23.197
You gave your heart to Koto
so that she could deliver

00:05:23.931 --> 00:05:25.899
your wish to heaven, didn't you?

00:05:27.401 --> 00:05:29.603
You gave the prayer beads
to Yakushimaru

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.606
because you wanted to change
light into darkness, right?

00:05:35.609 --> 00:05:36.577
You're silly.

00:05:37.578 --> 00:05:39.179
You didn't have to do this.

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:41.715
You could've just told them.

00:05:42.916 --> 00:05:46.420
That they themselves were your hope.

00:05:51.792 --> 00:05:52.759
But...

00:05:52.993 --> 00:05:56.563
They wouldn't want to hear
that from me, would they?

00:05:58.665 --> 00:06:01.101
Especially Yakushimaru.

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:04.938
He doesn't like me.

00:06:16.917 --> 00:06:17.718
What?

00:06:22.556 --> 00:06:28.128
That's who you are, and that's
why I wanted to be by your side.

00:06:30.564 --> 00:06:35.502
That's who you are, and that's
why I was able to give you Koto.

00:06:37.671 --> 00:06:40.073
She understands perfectly.

00:06:42.209 --> 00:06:45.345
Your love, your worries...

00:06:47.581 --> 00:06:48.615
It's all right.

00:06:49.182 --> 00:06:53.687
Yase, Kurama, and Yakushimaru, too.
All your kids do.

00:06:55.822 --> 00:06:59.860
So return to them and help them.

00:07:00.928 --> 00:07:04.698
If you don't,
the world will truly be destroyed.

00:07:06.767 --> 00:07:13.040
To Yakushimaru... those prayer
beads are still nothing but a burden.

00:07:23.283 --> 00:07:23.884
My love...

00:07:28.221 --> 00:07:29.823
| placed a bet.

00:07:30.958 --> 00:07:32.192
With myself as the wager.

00:07:39.066 --> 00:07:43.303
So that in the end,
| could love myself.

00:07:50.811 --> 00:07:54.448
So I can't give up before the end.

00:07:55.716 --> 00:07:56.516
Don't worry.

00:07:57.284 --> 00:08:00.620
No matter what happens,
the world won't end.

00:08:07.594 --> 00:08:10.731
At worst, I'll just disappear.

00:08:13.533 --> 00:08:15.736
I'm supposed to be a god,

00:08:16.503 --> 00:08:19.873
but I couldn't even save you from this place.

00:08:21.174 --> 00:08:23.510
Koto got here before I did.

00:08:25.679 --> 00:08:27.914
The wish I have that
| can't make come true...

00:08:28.782 --> 00:08:31.051
They'll make it come true.

00:08:32.619 --> 00:08:33.720
Until I met you,

00:08:34.154 --> 00:08:38.358
the world was just a place
to wander aimlessly,

00:08:38.992 --> 00:08:41.928
like a dream you fell in and out of.

00:08:43.597 --> 00:08:45.766
It was only after I met
you and the children

00:08:46.199 --> 00:08:49.870
that I really found my world.

00:08:51.938 --> 00:08:53.407
Don't disappear, Koto.

00:08:54.875 --> 00:08:56.443
You have to live.

00:09:16.129 --> 00:09:16.797
Koto...

00:09:17.264 --> 00:09:22.903
Don't make Mom cry!

00:09:27.974 --> 00:09:29.976
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:09:29.976 --> 00:09:31.445
Chapter 29: (Past
—) Present (23)/ Koto

00:09:36.583 --> 00:09:37.217
Hey.

00:09:42.022 --> 00:09:42.923
That hurt.

00:09:42.923 --> 00:09:44.558
What are you doing?

00:09:45.592 --> 00:09:47.427
You don't have to die anymore, right?

00:09:49.262 --> 00:09:51.698
That's what using
the beads represents, isn't it?

00:09:52.799 --> 00:09:57.471
Or are you just doing it
to save the Looking Glass City?

00:10:01.007 --> 00:10:02.909
To be honest, I don't know.

00:10:04.444 --> 00:10:06.246
But for now...

00:10:07.314 --> 00:10:09.416
| can't, not yet.

00:10:12.853 --> 00:10:14.621
| can't die yet.

00:10:16.123 --> 00:10:18.725
Not me, or this city...

00:11:05.338 --> 00:11:06.706
Amazing.

00:11:42.642 --> 00:11:43.843
Where are we?

00:11:44.311 --> 00:11:45.278
| don't know.

00:11:45.478 --> 00:11:47.414
Takamagahara. The celestial plane.

00:11:48.782 --> 00:11:51.918
From the look on your face,
you have no idea what's going on.

00:11:52.285 --> 00:11:56.423
This is a splendid place,
where your brain controls everything.

00:12:03.129 --> 00:12:05.298
Welcome, my grandchildren.

00:12:05.498 --> 00:12:07.000
I'm happy to meet you.

00:12:09.536 --> 00:12:10.136
Who are you?

00:12:10.337 --> 00:12:13.707
Your dad's father.

00:12:14.474 --> 00:12:17.944
What the hell is the priest's
dad doing here now?

00:12:20.914 --> 00:12:23.683
He's here to yell at you,
'cause you failed.

00:12:24.951 --> 00:12:26.152
Not at all.

00:12:26.786 --> 00:12:29.022
The world has been
successfully restored,

00:12:29.456 --> 00:12:32.292
and the 13th planet has been
accepted like the others.

00:12:32.726 --> 00:12:35.629
That's why I called you,
my grandchildren.

00:12:36.696 --> 00:12:39.232
You are going to take my
son's place, and become

00:12:39.232 --> 00:12:40.600
God
the next gods.

00:12:41.968 --> 00:12:43.970
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.438
Chapter 30: The
Present (30)/ Here

00:12:45.672 --> 00:12:46.640
Okay!

00:12:48.074 --> 00:12:48.508
What?

00:12:48.875 --> 00:12:49.542
Shouldn't 1?

00:12:49.542 --> 00:12:51.878
Impossible
| don't know if I'd say you shouldn't...

00:12:51.878 --> 00:12:53.280
Duty
I've caused a ton

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:54.714
of trouble, though.

00:12:54.981 --> 00:12:57.250
* (Hypothetical) And since our
grandpa was nice enough to call me here,

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.885
| figured it'd be rude to refuse.

00:13:00.053 --> 00:13:02.656
But I have just one question.

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:06.159
What do you mean, exactly,
by "taking Dad's place"?

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:08.728
When the decision is made,

00:13:09.195 --> 00:13:11.731
the soul's transfer will be complete.

00:13:12.065 --> 00:13:13.967
The laws of the universe will change,

00:13:14.501 --> 00:13:16.936
and my son's existence will be erased.

00:13:22.876 --> 00:13:24.044
| won't do it, then.

00:13:24.944 --> 00:13:26.513
| don't want Dad to disappear.

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:29.549
But that is my son's wish.

00:13:31.117 --> 00:13:32.285
Is it really? Truly?

00:13:32.285 --> 00:13:33.987
Right Wrong
It's real, and true.

00:13:33.987 --> 00:13:35.388
Really, truly?

00:13:35.388 --> 00:13:36.923
Really, truly.

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:38.758
What hour, what minute, what day?

00:13:38.758 --> 00:13:40.860
After how many revolutions
of the planes?

00:13:41.194 --> 00:13:42.595
That's enough.

00:13:43.596 --> 00:13:46.499
My dad always hides the truth.

00:13:46.633 --> 00:13:48.134
You know that, don't you, Myoue?

00:13:48.968 --> 00:13:50.270
He wants to disappear?

00:13:50.870 --> 00:13:54.641
Deep down, there's no way
that's really what he wants.

00:14:06.219 --> 00:14:07.053
Koto...

00:14:14.294 --> 00:14:15.095
I'll go ask him.

00:14:15.328 --> 00:14:15.962
What?!

00:14:15.962 --> 00:14:17.364
I'll ask him myself!

00:14:17.931 --> 00:14:20.433
Don't tell me you're willing
to just let this go, Myoue!

00:14:20.433 --> 00:14:22.335
With him just up and disappearing?

00:14:33.646 --> 00:14:34.314
Point taken.

00:14:42.789 --> 00:14:44.290
Give me a sec, Grandpa.

00:14:44.791 --> 00:14:47.827
We're gonna go see Dad.

00:14:49.829 --> 00:14:51.698
Sorry, but we can talk...

00:14:51.998 --> 00:14:52.866
...after that.

00:15:03.643 --> 00:15:05.345
Future Present Past

00:15:08.348 --> 00:15:09.716
What is this?

00:15:10.216 --> 00:15:11.918
| have no idea.

00:15:23.129 --> 00:15:23.797
Myoue.

00:15:26.099 --> 00:15:27.600
| was wondering...

00:15:28.334 --> 00:15:31.137
Do you think we can stay
together a little bit longer?

00:15:32.872 --> 00:15:35.675
You've lived this long,

00:15:36.376 --> 00:15:38.411
and you even came back to life.

00:15:40.079 --> 00:15:42.849
I'll finish you off whenever you want.

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:46.186
So stick with me just a little more.

00:15:49.889 --> 00:15:51.024
Live, Myoue!

00:15:53.993 --> 00:15:54.861
Live.

00:15:55.728 --> 00:15:56.996
You might not want to...

00:15:59.799 --> 00:16:01.901
And I know it's selfish to ask, but...

00:16:04.037 --> 00:16:06.973
It'd make me really happy.

00:16:09.075 --> 00:16:09.576
Dad!

00:16:13.246 --> 00:16:14.047
Mom?

00:16:18.551 --> 00:16:19.819
Let's be happy!

00:16:20.553 --> 00:16:23.289
With everybody, if we can,
for as long as we live.

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:27.193
And for happiness,
I'm sure we can...

00:16:28.561 --> 00:16:31.731
...start over as
many time as it takes!

00:16:32.232 --> 00:16:34.267
All right!

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:41.007
Dad!

00:16:49.449 --> 00:16:52.519
| found you!

00:17:04.597 --> 00:17:05.565
Yakushimaru!

00:17:05.865 --> 00:17:07.267
Hey, Koto!

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:09.302
Are you trying to kill him?

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:31.424
Out of the way!

00:17:31.424 --> 00:17:32.525
Yakushimaru!

00:17:37.597 --> 00:17:38.431
So, we heard.

00:17:39.198 --> 00:17:42.902
You're going to turn your job over
to me and Myoue and disappear, huh?

00:17:49.609 --> 00:17:51.744
You really are selfish.

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:55.081
Why me?

00:17:55.515 --> 00:17:57.283
Are you okay, Yakushimaru?

00:18:01.721 --> 00:18:02.722
What about you, Mom?

00:18:07.160 --> 00:18:08.161
Yakushimaru?

00:18:10.196 --> 00:18:12.165
What are you doing?

00:18:13.099 --> 00:18:14.367
Grandpa!

00:18:14.767 --> 00:18:16.869
Didn't you come to talk to him?

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:18.838
| thought that was the plan...

00:18:24.911 --> 00:18:25.678
Oh, my...

00:18:26.179 --> 00:18:27.981
What is she doing?

00:18:28.815 --> 00:18:30.483
You've never had one of those?

00:18:31.484 --> 00:18:33.219
Just a father-and-child squabble.

00:18:35.188 --> 00:18:39.392
You always say you love us,
don't you, Dad?

00:18:40.660 --> 00:18:43.096
But you don't understand anything!

00:18:46.332 --> 00:18:50.036
Then do you understand, Koto?

00:18:59.946 --> 00:19:00.847
We always used to...

00:19:02.649 --> 00:19:04.751
...watch the sunset together, didn't we?

00:19:05.151 --> 00:19:06.886
We used to eat dinner together, right?

00:19:07.754 --> 00:19:08.955
That's what...

00:19:09.856 --> 00:19:10.623
...love is!

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:19.599
Fighting over trivial things...

00:19:19.866 --> 00:19:21.701
Laughing over stupid things...

00:19:22.035 --> 00:19:24.737
Coming home five minutes
earlier than usual...

00:19:25.772 --> 00:19:27.874
That's what love is!

00:19:33.513 --> 00:19:36.616
Laughing, crying,
getting angry, being happy...

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:39.952
We did all that together, didn't we?

00:19:41.154 --> 00:19:44.257
That's what love is!

00:19:57.737 --> 00:19:59.672
You're the one who
taught me that, Dad.

00:20:01.074 --> 00:20:01.708
So why...

00:20:03.810 --> 00:20:06.379
Why are you trying to just disappear?

00:20:10.216 --> 00:20:11.684
| don't want you to!

00:20:13.886 --> 00:20:15.388
| love you!

00:20:22.095 --> 00:20:24.664
Don't leave me, Sensei...

00:20:26.799 --> 00:20:27.300
Okay.

00:20:37.643 --> 00:20:38.578
Mom!

00:20:38.578 --> 00:20:39.345
Yase!

00:20:40.246 --> 00:20:41.147
Sis!

00:20:41.147 --> 00:20:42.048
Koto!

00:20:42.048 --> 00:20:43.282
A! Un!

00:20:46.953 --> 00:20:48.621
Here's your judgment.

00:20:49.822 --> 00:20:54.327
Your children shall inherit your
soul, and you get to remain.

00:20:54.327 --> 00:20:55.361
Dad?

00:20:55.595 --> 00:20:56.329
Your job's done.

00:20:57.563 --> 00:21:02.769
You're telling me to stay?
But I have nothing, now.

00:21:04.437 --> 00:21:06.472
I... am nothing, now.

00:21:10.676 --> 00:21:11.544
Dad!

00:21:11.778 --> 00:21:13.412
Is it not enough to just be?

00:21:14.914 --> 00:21:16.983
Is it not enough to just be?

00:21:24.457 --> 00:21:28.327
I'd say that's all the reason
you should need, my son.

00:21:37.703 --> 00:21:38.771
Dad!

00:21:56.122 --> 00:21:57.290
You can have these back.

00:21:59.292 --> 00:22:02.495
And now, give them to me.

00:22:05.698 --> 00:22:08.201
Are you glad you stayed alive?

00:22:08.434 --> 00:22:09.268
No idea.

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:16.175
But I hope I feel that way,
the next time I die.

00:22:16.809 --> 00:22:18.711
"The next time I die."
Who says that?

00:22:18.711 --> 00:22:19.612
Shut up.

00:22:21.414 --> 00:22:22.014
Dad.

00:22:23.516 --> 00:22:26.686
I'll never be able to replace you.

00:22:27.820 --> 00:22:31.457
But I'll stay by your side as
much as I can, and listen to you.

00:22:32.091 --> 00:22:35.862
We'll eat dinner, tell jokes,
and we'll laugh together.

00:22:36.562 --> 00:22:37.797
Just like we always have.

00:22:38.698 --> 00:22:43.970
That's the world I want to share with you.

00:22:44.937 --> 00:22:48.841
| told you she'd be fine.

00:22:50.710 --> 00:22:52.545
She's your daughter, after all.

00:22:52.845 --> 00:22:54.380
You raised her.

00:22:55.948 --> 00:22:56.482
Koto!

00:22:57.516 --> 00:22:59.518
You did good, kiddo.

00:23:01.687 --> 00:23:04.724
You taught your stubborn
dad a lesson, didn't you?

00:23:04.991 --> 00:23:05.524
Yup!

00:23:08.761 --> 00:23:11.397
Even here of all places,
you're only thinking of yourself.

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:13.633
| don't want to lose my family again.

00:23:13.766 --> 00:23:14.834
So, Dad,

00:23:15.301 --> 00:23:16.903
come back with us!

00:23:18.471 --> 00:23:20.673
| may have the prayer beads now,

00:23:21.707 --> 00:23:24.877
but the Looking Glass City is
your home. The home you made.

00:23:26.913 --> 00:23:28.948
Right, Dad?

00:23:32.318 --> 00:23:35.154
| haven't seen you cry in a long time.

00:23:36.856 --> 00:23:39.225
| never cried.

00:23:39.692 --> 00:23:40.459
You did so.

00:23:40.459 --> 00:23:40.927
Did not.

00:23:41.193 --> 00:23:41.961
Did so!

00:23:41.961 --> 00:23:42.628
Did not.

00:23:42.628 --> 00:23:43.829
Did so!

00:23:43.829 --> 00:23:44.964
Did not.

00:23:45.298 --> 00:23:46.799
Did soooo!

00:23:51.704 --> 00:23:52.705
Sometimes.

00:23:54.740 --> 00:23:58.344
Sometimes, everything I do
seems so pointless.

00:23:58.644 --> 00:24:00.046
What are you talking about?

00:24:00.546 --> 00:24:03.816
Thanks to you, the world
is turning just fine today.

00:24:04.450 --> 00:24:05.985
That's what my job is.

00:24:06.719 --> 00:24:08.087
Don't be so pessimistic.

00:24:08.421 --> 00:24:09.789
You want my job?

00:24:10.056 --> 00:24:10.890
Nope.

00:24:11.757 --> 00:24:15.361
That belongs to you,
and no one else.

00:24:16.262 --> 00:24:17.730
Will you be back?

00:24:18.497 --> 00:24:19.365
I'll stop by.

00:24:21.434 --> 00:24:22.735
He's so free-spirited.

00:24:23.970 --> 00:24:25.604
Are you jealous?

00:24:57.403 --> 00:24:59.672
Once, in a place far away,

00:25:00.840 --> 00:25:03.309
when many planets intermingled and

00:25:03.809 --> 00:25:07.079
the boundary between man
and god was vague...

00:25:08.514 --> 00:25:15.588
There was a tale of a particular family.
A tale of love and rebirth.

00:25:21.527 --> 00:25:24.964
K'Yy O U S O UG I G A

00:25:27.500 --> 00:25:29.468
So this is the last time, huh?

00:25:29.702 --> 00:25:31.470
What do you think, Inuyama?

00:25:46.652 --> 00:25:50.122
Next time on Kyousougiga: "Review."

00:25:50.122 --> 00:25:51.590
Let's go over what we've learned!

00:25:51.590 --> 00:25:52.958
Includes commentary!
